40
00:02:04.317 --> 00:02:19.992
Malis goes to a concert. The conductor lifts her hands and the orchestra begins. A lady plays the beautiful harp, and a man plays the big cello. The tuba goes oom-pah, and the trombone slides up and down. Malis claps for a long time!

41
